- `crates/familiar-ai-daemon/src/control_plane.rs` — thin `ControlPlaneService` wrappers (`acquire_repository_lease`, `renew_repository_lease`, `release_repository_lease`, `inspect_repository_lease`).
- `crates/familiar-ai-daemon/src/worker_lock.rs` — new `HostLease` guard: acquires via the DB, spawns a renewal thread on a configured heartbeat, flips `is_live()` false and records a `lost` event on expiry/takeover/store error, releases on `Drop`. Purely additive — the existing filesystem `WorkerLock` is untouched.
